                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "If this year had a \u201cCongressional Wrapped,\u201d it would show a simple truth: my team has put in the work. \n\nWe moved serious legislation on national security, border enforcement, and military readiness. We focused on problems families actually feel at home, on health care, affordability, and safer communities. And we returned over $10 million to the people of #NC10 by fighting through federal red tape on their behalf. \n\nI\u2019m proud of what we\u2019ve built this year, and I\u2019m ready to deliver even more next.",
