                "retweet_count": 3,
                "source": "Twitter for iPhone",
                "text": "Why should a family in rural North Carolina have to drive two hours to see a specialist when that appointment could happen from their kitchen table? \n\nI've cosponsored the CONNECT for Health Act to remove the outdated restrictions keeping telehealth out of reach for the people who need it most. This bill expands mental health access, lets patients get care from home, and stops punishing rural communities for where they live.",
